{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-巨量营销智擎版\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"用于批量添加投放项目下的素材，包括视频、图片、图文、试玩、直玩等素材。支持多种素材类型和相关配置，如视频素材主页可见性设置等。配合接口有【获取视频素材】【获取图片素材】等。\",\"id\":\"oc_project.material.create\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/oc_project/material/create/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1854929666566346\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.video.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad\\u0026type=api\\u0026id=1696710601820172\",\"reason\":\"添加视频素材时需要通过此接口获取视频ID\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取视频素材\"},{\"id\":\"ad.image.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710601254912\",\"reason\":\"添加图片素材时需要通过此接口获取图片ID\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取图片素材\"},{\"id\":\"aweme.video.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1729982871844879\",\"reason\":\"添加抖音短视频素材时需要通过此接口获取抖音短视频ID\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取抖音主页视频\"},{\"id\":\"aweme.auth.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1729983667746823\",\"reason\":\"添加抖音短视频素材时需要通过此接口获取抖音短视频ID\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取抖音授权关系\"},{\"id\":\"carousel.material.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1773554026740736\",\"reason\":\"添加图文素材时需要通过此接口获取图文ID\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取图文素材\"},{\"id\":\"aweme.carousel.material.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1812353010729227\",\"reason\":\"添加抖音图文素材时需要通过此接口获取item_id\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取创编可用的抖音图文素材\"},{\"id\":\"play.material.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1836615534374475\",\"reason\":\"添加试玩/直玩素材时需要通过此接口获取素材uri\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取试玩/直玩素材列表\"},{\"id\":\"video.upload\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1696710600730639\",\"reason\":\"添加试玩素材时需要通过此接口上传引导视频并获取引导视频ID\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"上传视频\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1854929666566346\",\"title\":\"批量添加投放项目下素材\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1ac03d43cppc0\">批量添加投放项目下素材</p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1853917265501184%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%223hMZj%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-71oo5h83sdg00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-71oo5h83sdg00\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-g51zsqniaqw00\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/oc_project/material/create/<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1854929666566346\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-bmhemcblwdc00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-bmhemcblwdc00\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-i2rgpvzieeo00\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-j52id9l2lzs00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-j52id9l2lzs00\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-u7310k288jk0\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-u7310k288jk0\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-ft14alcqp0w00\">客户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">project_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1tv4fmnr52dc00\">项目id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_material_list</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-51uvmiupox0000\">视频素材信息，单次追投最多可添加200个素材（总素材量，包含视频、图片、图文）</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">image_mode</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5c0xel6dphw000\">视频素材类型，允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-19slk4pusggw00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-12lr1d7wqqdc00\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_VIDEO_VERTICAL</code> 竖版视频</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-21fcdmsy900000\"><code><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7;\">CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_VIDE</span></code><span style=\"background-color: #f5f6f7;\"> 横版视频</span></li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-igyfnz1g23400\">视频ID，可通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1696710601820172\">【获取视频素材】</a>或【获取账户可用的组织视频列表】接口获得</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_cover_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-iyvnirsjan400\">视频封面图片ID，可通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710601820172?origin=left_nav\">【获取视频素材】</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710601254912\">【获取图片素材】</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710602404864?origin=left_nav\">【获取视频智能封面】</a>接口获取。</p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-vra9rvwit9c00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-537741zfa1c000\">（视频封面与视频绑定能力全新上线，<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">素材库视频与创编主流程使用的同一视频素材将对应绑定同一个视频封面，即</span>您无需填写该字段，<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">传入即为人工自提-</span>更改封面图片绑定关系。）</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">item_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-irfw3bp897400\">注：当aweme_id传入时有效</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-hsrbgywcc0800\">抖音短视频ID，通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1729982871844879\">【获取抖音主页视频】</a>或 <a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1729983667746823\">【获取抖音授权关系】</a>获取主页视频或合作授权视频</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_hp_visibility</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-idc00krvt0o00\">视频素材主页可见性设置，该参数只针对非抖音视频生效，可选值:</p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-kh2hohzhdpc0\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-95nc0aqhf9w00\">ALWAYS_VISIBLE 主页始终可见</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1s3ukd3qn4e80\">HIDE_VIDEO_ON_HP 仅单次展示可见（默认值）</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">guide_video_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-54m77r1zuuk00\">引导视频id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">image_material_list</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2ll4uzhesmo000\">图片素材信息，，单次追投最多可添加200个素材</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">image_mode</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-73mzuwyn4ao00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-i747ovy3ohk00\"><code>AWEME_PHOTO</code> 图文素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-6xa2m9mrrhw00\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_AWEME_LIVE</code> 直播创意素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-7813dg6rvyo00\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_CALIBRATION_FREE_SINGLE_IMAGE</code> 穿山甲免校验</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-lnyi6uoso0w0\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_CALIBRATION_FREE_VIDEO</code> 穿山甲免校验</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5e6ayzb4fgc00\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_DISPLAY_WINDOW</code> 头条搜索投放通用橱窗样式</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-kkuo0dguvao0\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_GIF</code> </li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-avt5kz8hqbs00\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_GROUP</code> </li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-kjtvqtuc0bk00\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_INSTANT_PLAY</code> 直玩</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-kvitgcbxfnk00\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_LARGE</code> </li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-efs6na9m7k000\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_LARGE_VERTICAL</code> 大图竖版图</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3n8ttstjor200\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_PLAYABLE_HORIZONTAL</code> 试玩</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3nxzsmg0oy800\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_PLAYABLE_VERTICAL</code> 试玩</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-l1mqcqgpe1c00\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_SMALL</code> </li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5r5hicoeuk400\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_TRIAL_PLAY_LARGE</code> 试玩横屏</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5m7flnmzq9o00\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_TRIAL_PLAY_VERTICAL</code> 试玩竖屏</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-e02b19iu7co00\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_UNION_SPLASH</code> 网盟开屏</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-fmtn6zzqanc00\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_UNION_SPLASH_VIDEO</code> 互动创意</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-49qzjze3bpk00\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_VIDEO</code> 视频</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-8r5qfhw6wng00\"><code>CREATIVE_IMAGE_MODE_VIDEO_VERTICAL</code> 抖音&amp;火山竖版视频素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-gb8fz2soqfk00\"><code>SEARCH_AD_SMALL_IMAGE</code> 搜索小图</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-erab6hh4lu800\"><code>TOUTIAO_SEARCH_AD_IMAGE</code> 搜索大图</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">images</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-424zvg6qmsg000\">图片ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">image_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-iq50f3lfvm000\">图片ID，可通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710601254912\">【获取图片素材】</a>接口获得</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">carousel_material_list</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-36yrkbzdc48000\">图文素材信息</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">carousel_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-380di6ir13e000\">图文id，可通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1773554026740736\">获取图文素材</a>】接口获得</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">item_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3dp4ksux9x6000\">抖音图文id，需从【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1812353010729227\">获取创编可用的抖音图文素材</a>】接口获取item_id传入</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1f2jdiq51fmo00\">注意：投放抖音图文素材时，只需要传入item_id，不要传入carousel_id（2个同时传入只会使用item_id）</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_hp_visibility</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">抖音主页图文可见性，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-kq4f4hti8u800\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5dcatkqu9io00\"><code>ALWAYS_VISIBLE</code> 主页始终可见</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2vhrdzpamxk00\"><code>HIDE_VIDEO_ON_HP</code> 主页隐藏</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">trial_play_material_list</p></section></secti